name: Historical supporting sources, reader ownership, lesson draft and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_support.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/open.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 F-0001 · FINDING | source-finding
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 25 REUSABLE LESSONS | lessons
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE LESSON DRAFT | generation-plan
expect: One lesson job
ask: Does planning keep generation separate from human acceptance and context reuse, with one job, recorded source and no model request before approval?
keys: f
require-live-snap: 20 LESSON SUPPORTING FILES | supporting-picker
expect: Current paths
type: service.txt
keys: Space Tab
require-live-snap: 20 service.txt | cancelled-basket
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE LESSON DRAFT | basket-cancelled-to-plan
keys: f
require-live-snap: 20 0/16 chosen | reopened-empty-basket
type: service.txt
keys: Space C-u
type: policy.txt
keys: Space C-u
type: missing.txt
keys: Space Tab
require-live-snap: 20 3/16 chosen | selected-historical-paths
expect: policy.txt
expect: missing.txt
ask: Does the basket distinguish the current browsing list from historical source, allow an absent exact path, and retain explicit selection order without spending?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Supporting files: 3 selected | planned-paths
keys: t
type: 2
keys: Enter r
type: 1
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_support.py draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: v
require-live-snap: 20 HISTORICAL LESSON SOURCE | source-reader
expect: Shared source limit:
keys: Enter t n f G
paste-file: @ART/retained.txt
require-live-snap: 20 HISTORICAL LESSON SOURCE | reader-owns-keys
expect-not: REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE
expect-not: Keep this unsubmitted note
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 no retained source membership | missing-source
expect-not: CURRENT_ONLY
keys: Home
resize: 160x48
live-snap: plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: plan-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: plan-40x12-last
ask: Across six sizes, can the operator read every historical source and omission, including deleted policy text, with scroll position and a visible return control?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Draft ready | source-reader-return
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
expect: Evidence: exact confirmed observation
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-last
expect: 1 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Threat context: not used for lesson drafts
expect-not: legacy selection
ask: Does approval bind exactly one job and one attempt to the original confirmation, selected model and two total calls, with one protected Review call and uncertain dollar consumption?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved lesson job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | before-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_support.py finished @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | generation-result
expect: Inspect model-proposed lesson
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled model lesson | saved-draft
expect: Proposed by:
expect: Captured historical source supplied.
ask: Does the actual executor expose only a model draft, with model and source omissions disclosed, unchanged finding decisions and explicit later human acceptance?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: source-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: source-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: source-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: source-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: PageDown
require-live-snap: 20 Captured historical source | source-40x12
expect: Supporting source: saved bundle
expect: Evidence text:
keys: PageDown
require-live-snap: 20 Provider retries | source-retry-40x12
ask: Is historical source distinct from the evidence text size, provider retry accounting and finding verdict, including at 40 columns by paging?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
keys: a
paste-file: @ART/reason.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM ACCEPTED LESSON | acceptance-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Labeled model | accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_support.py accepted @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | recovered-job
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATED LESSON DRAFT | recovered-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Labeled model | recovered-lesson
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_support.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does restart authenticate the original generated revision and preserve acceptance and consumed allowance without another model request or job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
